# shell: both
# home: fixture
# NeXT UIG ch6: a keyboard chord for a command the menu would show grey
# answers out loud instead of being silently swallowed.
wait 8
note nothing is selected, so Open by chord has nothing to open
key o ctrl
wait 3
expect-status not available here
note and the fall-through table is gated the same way
key u ctrl
wait 3
expect-status Unmount is not available here
quit
